(7400578, 1164388, 124190, '<td valign="top">Main Entry: naturally<br/>Part of Speech: adverb<br/>Definition: as anticipated<br/>Synonyms: artlessly, but of course, by birth, by nature, candidly, casually, characteristically, commonly, consistently, customarily, easily, freely, generally, genuinely, habitually, impulsively, informally, innocently, instinctively, normally, openly, ordinarily, readily, simply, spontaneously, typically, unaffectedly, uniformly, unpretentiously, usually<br/> <br/>Zeus, you may want to look up..."naturally" and see how it''s quite possible that man made architectural features naturally frame things around them....there is more than one way to use most words.</td>', 'Main Entry: naturallyPart of Speech: adverbDefinition: as anticipatedSynonyms: artlessly, but of course, by birth, by nature, candidly, casually, characteristically, commonly, consistently, customarily, easily, freely, generally, genuinely, habitually, impulsively, informally, innocently, instinctively, normally, openly, ordinarily, readily, simply, spontaneously, typically, unaffectedly, uniformly, unpretentiously, usually Zeus, you may want to look up..."naturally" and see how it''s quite possible that man made architectural features naturally frame things around them....there is more than one way to use most words.', '2015-08-28 11:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
